---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base lang="en" title="Privacy – Owldom" description="Privacy policy">
  <main class="block" style="padding-top:48px">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <h3>Controller</h3>
      <p>Boris Schmidt, Zeitmasz, c/o MDC#2311, Welserstraße 3, 87463 Dietmannsried, Germany<br />Email: <a href="mailto:boris@zeitmasz.com">boris@zeitmasz.com</a></p>

      <h3>In short</h3>
      <p>This website sets no cookies and does no cross-site tracking. For anonymous visitor statistics we use Umami (see below). Fonts are served from our own server.</p>

      <h3>Hosting and server logs</h3>
      <p>This website is hosted by Netlify, Inc., 101 2nd Street, San Francisco, CA 94105, USA. When you visit, Netlify processes technically necessary data such as IP address, date and time, requested page, referrer and browser identifier in order to deliver the site and protect it against abuse. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in a secure, working website). Transfers to the USA are based on a data processing agreement with EU Standard Contractual Clauses and/or the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.</p>

      <h3>Visitor statistics (Umami)</h3>
      <p>We use Umami Cloud (Umami Software, Inc., USA) to see how often and via which routes the site is visited. Umami works without cookies and does not store IP addresses or other personal data; only anonymous information such as page visited, referrer, browser, device type and country is collected. Individual visitors cannot be recognised. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in anonymous audience measurement). Details: <a href="https://umami.is/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">umami.is/privacy</a>.</p>

      <h3>Bandcamp player</h3>
      <p>The Bandcamp player only loads when you click it. Only then is a connection made to bandcamp.com (Songtradr, Inc., USA), transmitting your IP address among other data; Bandcamp sets cookies. Legal basis: your consent by clicking (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). Details: <a href="https://bandcamp.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">bandcamp.com/privacy</a>.</p>

      <h3>External links</h3>
      <p>Links to streaming services, shops, GoFundMe and social networks are plain links. No data is sent to these providers until you click a link; their privacy policies then apply.</p>

      <h3>Contact by email</h3>
      <p>If you email us, we process your details to handle your request (Art. 6(1)(b) or (f) GDPR) and delete them once they are no longer needed and no retention obligations apply.</p>

      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>You have the right of access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection to processing based on legitimate interests (Art. 15–21 GDPR). You can withdraw consent at any time with effect for the future. You may also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.</p>

      <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>
    <p><a href="/">Owldom</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
